pan class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">epost</span> : <span class=\"fn\">EPred</span>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">as</span> : <span class=\"fn\">Pred</span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Internal/Order/Heyting.html#Lean.Order.Heyting\">Lean.Order.Heyting</a> <span class=\"fn\">Pred</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Std/WP/Triple/Basic.html#Std.WP.Triple\">⦃</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/Internal/Order/Basic.html#Lean.Order.meet\">Lean.Order.meet</a> <span class=\"fn\">as</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Std/Internal/Order/Heyting.html#Lean.Order.himp\">Lean.Order.himp</a> <span class=\"fn\">as</span> <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">post</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#PUnit.unit\">PUnit.unit</a>)</span>)</span></span> <a href=\"./Std/WP/Triple/Basic.html#Std.WP.Triple\">⦄</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Std/WP/Gadget/Assert.html#Std.WP.Gadget.assertGadget\">Gadget.assertGadget</a> <span class=\"fn\">as</span></span> <a href=\"./Std/WP/Triple/Basic.html#Std.WP.Triple\">⦃</a> <span class=\"fn\">post</span><a href=\"./Std/WP/Triple/Basic.html#Std.WP.Triple\">;</a> <span class=\"fn\">epost</span> <a href=\"./Std/WP/Triple/Basic.html#Std.WP.Triple\">⦄</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Specification for `assertGadget`: the precondition requires both the assertion `as` and\nthe Heyting implication `as ⇨ post ⟨⟩`, ensuring the assertion holds and the postcondition\nfollows from it. ","docLink":"./Std/WP/Gadget/Assert.html#Std.WP.Spec.assertGadget","kind":"theorem","line":37,"name":"Std.WP.Spec.assertGadget","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Std/WP/Gadget/Assert.lean#L37-L45"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"d