on used as a verification gadget to inject assertions into the program.\n\nThe `as` parameter is the assertion to be checked. At runtime, `assertGadget` is simply\n`pure ⟨⟩`. ","docLink":"./Std/WP/Gadget/Assert.html#Std.WP.Gadget.assertGadget","kind":"def","line":27,"name":"Std.WP.Gadget.assertGadget","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/11acb17ec6b07a8f9e9173e6845197929540936b/src/Std/WP/Gadget/Assert.lean#L27-L31"}}],"imports":["Std.Internal.Order.Heyting","Std.WP.Triple.Monad"],"instances":[],"name":"Std.WP.Gadget.Assert"}